---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Write for Us"
  description="Submit cricket analysis, stories and original breakdowns to CricBreakdown."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-20">
    <span class="stat-chip text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E94560]">Contribute</span>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl text-[#1A1A2E] mt-3">Write for Us</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-ink/65 leading-relaxed mt-6">
      Have a cricket story worth breaking down? We welcome original analysis,
      statistical deep-dives, historical pieces and thoughtful cricket writing.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-xl bg-white border border-[#e3e7ee] p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4">What we look for</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink/70 list-disc pl-5">
        <li>Original cricket analysis backed by reliable statistics.</li>
        <li>Clear, useful breakdowns rather than generic match summaries.</li>
        <li>IPL, international cricket, cricket history and data-led stories.</li>
        <li>Original work that has not been copied or published elsewhere.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink/55">
        To pitch an article, please use the Contact page with your proposed topic,
        a short outline and a brief introduction about yourself.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex mt-6 bg-[#E94560] text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md font-semibold hover:bg-[#C73652] transition-colors">
        Send a pitch →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
